# Final deny rules take precedence over earlier exceptions.
**/compose.env.local
**/compose.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/secrets
**/secrets/**
**/bootstrap
**/installer
**/runtime
**/authority
**/operator
**/*pycache*
**/*pycache*/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*.bak
**/*~
